          "property": "MinStopDistanceTicks",
          "displayName": "Min Stop Distance (Ticks)",
          "description": "Floor on how close the stop may sit to the market. A market entry fills at the next tick rather than at the bar close, so a stop placed on top of the reference price is rejected as through-market. Also the cushion the trailing stop keeps off the live bid/ask. 0 = no floor (not recommended).",
