        {
          "property": "MaxStopDistanceTicks",
          "displayName": "Max Stop Distance (Ticks)",
          "description": "Hard cap on how far the stop may sit from entry. A far-away structural stop gets rejected by the broker's price-band limits, leaving the position unprotected. If the structural stop exceeds this, it is clamped in tight. 0 = no cap (dangerous with structural stops).",
